// Dev-only bootstrap, applied once at image build time.
//
// Both steps below exist to remove first-connection failures. Neither is
// appropriate for anything but a local development instance.

zn "%SYS"

// Stock IRIS images ship _SYSTEM with its password flagged as expired. That turns
// the very first DB-API connect into an authentication error rather than a
// session, which reads like a wrong-password bug and is not.
do ##class(Security.Users).UnExpireUserPasswords("*")

// %Service_CallIn is what allows the Native API and Embedded Python to attach to
// the IRIS process. Disabled by default.
set props("Enabled") = 1
do ##class(Security.Services).Modify("%Service_CallIn", .props)

halt
